Migrating ReadCaloCrosstalkMap to return spans.

It would be better for the methods of ReadCaloCrosstalkMap to return
spans rather than references to vectors.  That then gives implementations
the freedom to store the data in a different way (for example, flattening
the nested vectors).

This is the third step towards that.  We change the clients to use the
span methods, and remove from ReadCaloCrosstalkMap the methods returning
vectors.
